        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions SNJ1021SBR, San Juan Scroll Style Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe classic Scroll design is one of the all time favorite door pulls from First Impressions International. This beautiful ornate design adds class to any door. It can be surface mounted, back-to-back mounted, or thru-bolt mounted. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis decorative pull handle is normally used on entry doors, but also used as a <a href=\"/products/classic-ornate-scroll-appliance-door-pull-first-impressions-ap-snj1021sbr\"><b>Refrigerator Door Pull</b></a> or just about anywhere a large decorative door pull is needed. \r\n</p>\r\n \r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions SNJ1021SBR Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"made in the USA\">\r\n<li>Pull Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 21-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 20-1/2\" C/C</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-SNJ01-specifcations.pdf?v=1704262217\"><b>First Impressions SNJ1021SBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This Scroll Pull is handmade in the USA when you order it. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
